            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.26

- Replaced the unchanged native volume control with a visibly redesigned macOS 27-style slider.
- Added Apple's compact 140 × 20 geometry, a four-point translucent track, and a vertical liquid-glass thumb.
- Preserved precise dragging, system-glass interaction, and accessibility adjustments.
]]></description>
