            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.25

- Rebuilt the volume popover with macOS 27's native interactive clear-glass surface.
- Matched Apple's compact 140 × 20 small-slider geometry while preserving the existing popover size and animation.
- Removed the simulated blur, shimmer, border, and shadow layers for genuine system-rendered transparency and refraction.
]]></description>
